#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/client.md:54
msgid ""
"Unlike the backend script, this one doesn't have an explicit auth-token knob "
"yet — it relies on `Invoke-WebRequest -UseDefaultCredentials` or the absence "
"of auth on the `/api/app-packages/kanade-client/<v>` route. If your backend "
"gates that endpoint, add an `Authorization` header to the "
